[{"id":"app-testing-monkey-seed","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["Monkey","复现"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十一)Monkey 稳定性测试.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十一)Monkey 稳定性测试","articlePath":"posts/d377608d/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十一)Monkey 稳定性测试.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十一)Monkey 稳定性测试","articlePath":"posts/d377608d/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 Monkey 运行必须记录 seed？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>seed 决定伪随机事件序列；没有它就无法重放同一输入并收敛失败。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Monkey 是 Android 用来连续发送伪随机触摸、按键和生命周期事件的命令行工具；\u003ccode>seed\u003c/code> 是生成这串伪随机事件的起始数字，\u003ccode>count\u003c/code> 是事件数量。复现还需要同一 APK、设备、数据和事件参数：先用相同 seed 与 count 重跑，确认环境一致，再逐步缩短事件数，最后把最小序列转为有业务断言的人工或自动化用例。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"app-testing-evidence-chain","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["项目实战","证据"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十七)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十七)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c0a414ba/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十七)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十七)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c0a414ba/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>一条合格的 App 测试证据链至少包含哪些环节？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>固定构建与设备、记录最小步骤、同步采集日志和画面、保存系统状态、完成归因并脱敏交付。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>截图证明用户看到的画面，\u003ccode>logcat\u003c/code> (Android 系统/App 日志) 提供带时间的运行线索，设备和构建说明输入环境，步骤和数据让别人可以复现，系统状态帮助区分 Crash (进程崩溃)、ANR (应用无响应)、业务错误或环境问题。任一环节缺失都要标记证据不完整；“有一张截图”不能替代整条证据链。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a9-journal-filter","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["journalctl","日志"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(九)日志查看与故障定位.md","articleTitle":"Linux(九)日志查看与故障定位","articlePath":"posts/cade4656/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(九)日志查看与故障定位.md","articleTitle":"Linux(九)日志查看与故障定位","articlePath":"posts/cade4656/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>journalctl 排障时最有价值的三个过滤维度是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>服务 unit、故障时间窗和优先级；必要时再加 boot、内核或输出格式。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>日志量越大，先限定范围越重要。一个可复查的查询至少固定 unit、时间窗和优先级：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">UNIT=ssh.service\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">journalctl --unit \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$UNIT\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span> \\\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  --since \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;2026-08-26 10:00:00&#x27;\u003c/span> \\\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  --\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">until\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;2026-08-26 10:10:00&#x27;\u003c/span> \\\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  --priority warning..emerg --no-pager -o short-iso\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>--boot\u003c/code> 可再固定启动批次，\u003ccode>-o json\u003c/code> 适合机器采集。把命令和时间窗一起保存，别人才能区分“没有事件”和“过滤条件把事件排除了”。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-function-late-binding","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","闭包","lambda","循环"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(五)流程控制与函数.md","articleTitle":"Python(五)流程控制与函数","articlePath":"posts/a62147da/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(五)流程控制与函数.md","articleTitle":"Python(五)流程控制与函数","articlePath":"posts/a62147da/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么循环中创建的多个 lambda 常返回同一个最后值？如何修复？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>闭包在调用时查找循环名称，循环结束后它已是最后值；用默认参数或工厂函数绑定当前值。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>闭包捕获的是名称，函数真正调用时才通过该名称取值；循环结束后，所有 lambda 看到的自然是最后一次绑定：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">callbacks = []\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">for\u003c/span> item \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">in\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">range\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"number\">3\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    callbacks.append(\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">lambda\u003c/span>: item)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>([callback() \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">for\u003c/span> callback \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">in\u003c/span> callbacks])  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># [2, 2, 2]\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>默认参数会在函数创建时求值，因此能保存当前对象：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">callbacks = [\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">lambda\u003c/span> item=item: item \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">for\u003c/span> item \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">in\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">range\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"number\">3\u003c/span>)]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>([callback() \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">for\u003c/span> callback \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">in\u003c/span> callbacks])  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># [0, 1, 2]\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>这不是特殊的 lambda 规则，而是把“调用时查找外层名称”改成“创建时完成默认参数绑定”；需要更复杂状态时使用工厂函数会更清楚。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-03-deduplicate-delete-p2","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["DELETE","重复数据","自连接"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(三)数据写入与约束.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(三)数据写入与约束","articlePath":"posts/4df9aab4/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(三)数据写入与约束.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(三)数据写入与约束","articlePath":"posts/4df9aab4/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>原始导入 staging 表 \u003ccode>user_imports_raw\u003c/code> 中同一 \u003ccode>(source_name, external_id)\u003c/code> 出现重复记录，保留最早 \u003ccode>id\u003c/code>，删除其余记录，SQL 如何写？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">12\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">13\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">14\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">15\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">16\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">17\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">18\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">19\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">20\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">21\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">START\u003c/span> TRANSACTION;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\">-- 先预览，再在同一事务中删除\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> r.id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> user_imports_raw \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> r\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">JOIN\u003c/span> user_imports_raw \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> keep\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ON\u003c/span> keep.source_name \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> r.source_name\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\"> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> keep.external_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> r.external_id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\"> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> keep.id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&lt;\u003c/span> r.id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> r.id;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">DELETE\u003c/span> r\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> user_imports_raw \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> r\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">JOIN\u003c/span> user_imports_raw \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> keep\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\"> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ON\u003c/span> keep.source_name \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> r.source_name\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\"> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> keep.external_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> r.external_id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\"> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> keep.id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&lt;\u003c/span> r.id;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> ROW_COUNT() \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> deleted_rows;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\">-- 结果异常 ROLLBACK；确认只保留每组最早 id 后 COMMIT。\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">COMMIT\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>keep.id &lt; r.id\u003c/code> 把“最早”写成可审计的排序规则：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> r.id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> delete_id, keep.id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> keep_id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> user_imports_raw \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> r\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">JOIN\u003c/span> user_imports_raw \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> keep\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ON\u003c/span> keep.source_name \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> r.source_name\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\"> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> keep.external_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> r.external_id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\"> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> keep.id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&lt;\u003c/span> r.id;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>先检查这张预览表，再在同一事务中执行 \u003ccode>DELETE\u003c/code>，核对 \u003ccode>ROW_COUNT()\u003c/code> 和每组剩余行数。临时 staging 表可以允许重复，但正式表要在清理完成后用唯一键防止复发；一次性删除脚本不能替代长期约束。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]